{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.ord_zero_iff_rank_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.ord_zero_iff_rank_zero","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L72-L77","doc":"**Derived, sorry-free.** Analytic-rank–zero criterion: the\n`L`-function is non-vanishing at the central point (`ord = 0`) iff\nthe categorical rank is zero — the analytic reading of Weak `q`-BSD. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.full_bsd_rank0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.full_bsd_rank0","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L65-L65","doc":"**Full `q`-BSD, rank-0 collapse.** When `r_q = 0` the regulator and\ntorsion are trivial and the leading value is\n`L(𝓔_q, 1) = Ω_q · |Ш_q| · ∏_𝔪 c_𝔪(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.tamagawaProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.tamagawaProd","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L61-L61","doc":"`∏_𝔪 c_𝔪(q)`, the product of Tamagawa numbers. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.shaOrder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.shaOrder","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L59-L59","doc":"`|Ш_q(𝓔_q)|`, the order of the `q`-Tate–Shafarevich group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.omega","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.omega","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The Reeb period `Ω_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.leadingValue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.leadingValue","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L55-L55","doc":"The rank-0 leading value `L(𝓔_q, 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.weak_bsd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.weak_bsd","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L53-L53","doc":"**Weak `q`-BSD (the conjecture).** The analytic order of vanishing\nequals the categorical rank: `ord_{s=1} L(𝓔_q, s) = r_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.ordVanishing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.ordVanishing","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L50-L50","doc":"The analytic order of vanishing `ord_{s=1} L(𝓔_q, s)` of the\n`q`-deformed `L`-function at the central point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.qRank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.qRank","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The categorical rank `r_q = rank 𝓔_q(𝟏)` of the categorical\nMordell–Weil group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer.mk","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.QBirchSwinnertonDyer","kind":"class","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/QBirchSwinnertonDyer.lean#L37-L66","doc":"**The `q`-deformed Birch and Swinnerton-Dyer conjecture** — §3b\nconjecture class carrying Weak `q`-BSD (`ord = rank`) and the rank-0\nFull-BSD collapse.\n\nConjectural class — see\n[`conj:q-birch-swinnerton-dyer`](../../../quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/q-birch-swinnerton-dyer.md). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:q-birch-swinnerton-dyer","label":"conj:q-birch-swinnerton-dyer","md":"quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/q-birch-swinnerton-dyer.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}